sequenceDiagram
    %% High-level editor tool flow as currently implemented.
    %% See sequenceDiagram.mmd for the TranslateTool-specific deep dive.
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Viewport / UI
    participant App as Application + Tool Registry
    participant Tool as Active Editor Tool
    participant Ctx as IEditorToolContext
    participant History as CommandHistory
    participant State as Transient Editor State<br/>Selection + Previews
    participant Doc as Document / Scene
    participant Services as SceneServices<br/>Render + Picking + Gizmos

    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
        Note over User, Services: Input routing and tool decisions
        User->>UI: Perform an editor gesture
        UI->>App: Raise tool input phase
        App->>Tool: Dispatch to active tool with context
        Tool->>Ctx: Read document snapshots and query editor services
        Ctx-->>Tool: IDs, value data, selection, and interaction results
        Note over Tool, Doc: The tool receives no document mutation API
    end

    rect rgb(40, 40, 40)
        Note over User, Services: Transient preview during an interaction
        User->>UI: Continue gesture
        UI->>App: Raise updated tool input
        App->>Tool: Dispatch update
        Tool->>State: Set or update preview state
        State-->>Services: Preview changed
        Services-->>UI: Update derived visuals and picking
        Note over Tool, Doc: Preview updates do not mutate the document
    end

    rect rgb(30, 30, 30)
        Note over User, Services: Complete the action
        User->>UI: Complete gesture or action
        UI->>App: Raise completion input
        App->>Tool: Dispatch completion

        alt Action changes the document
            Tool->>History: Submit command containing mutation data
            History->>Doc: Execute command against Scene
            Doc-->>Services: Document change event
            Services-->>UI: Synchronize render, picking, and gizmos
            History->>History: Record successful command and clear redo
        else Action changes undoable transient state
            Tool->>History: Submit editor-state command
            History->>State: Execute command, such as selection change
            State-->>Services: Transient state changed
            Services-->>UI: Synchronize affected editor visuals
            History->>History: Record successful command and clear redo
        end

        Tool->>State: Clear preview
        State-->>Services: Preview changed
        Services-->>UI: Display authoritative document state
    end
